<p:sld xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main" xmlns:r="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/relationships" xmlns:p="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/presentationml/2006/main"><p:cSld><p:spTree><p:nvGrpSpPr><p:cNvPr id="1" name=""/><p:cNvGrpSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvGrpSpPr><p:grpSpPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="0" y="0"/><a:ext cx="0" cy="0"/><a:chOff x="0" y="0"/><a:chExt cx="0" cy="0"/></a:xfrm></p:grpSpPr><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="4" name="ZoneTexte 3"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{E86A45D0-9E61-EF23-481E-9876DCA4ADB7}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr txBox="1"/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="790832" y="407773"/><a:ext cx="4624984" cy="369332"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="none" rtlCol="0"><a:spAutoFit/></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>2. La démolition — Oser tout bousculer </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"/><a:t>🔨</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="fr-FR" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="5" name="ZoneTexte 4"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{ECEB57CF-291A-F653-4BD7-B4F5AF9F4C33}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr txBox="1"/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="926757" y="1334530"/><a:ext cx="10031913" cy="3693319"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="none" rtlCol="0"><a:spAutoFit/></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" b="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>Pour construire quelque chose de beau, il faut parfois oser tout chambouler !</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" b="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>Pas d'architecte</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>, un budget limité, beaucoup d'huile de coude et surtout </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>les précieux conseils et l'aide de mon beau-papa.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>Nous nous sommes lancés dans une rénovation complète !</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>J'ai cassé, démoli, évacué des tonnes de gravats, manié le marteau-piqueur… </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>Et recommencé, encore et encore !</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>Certains jours, je me demandais dans quoi nous nous étions embarqués ! Mais j'adorais ça.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>Derrière chaque mur abattu, j'imaginais déjà la suite. </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>Chaque difficulté devenait un nouveau défi à relever.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>Cette aventure m'a appris quelque chose d'essentiel : </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" b="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>pour donner vie à ses rêves, il faut parfois avoir le courage de tout remettre en question.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>Une leçon qui, quelques années plus tard, allait prendre tout son sens dans ma propre vie… 💙</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:endParaRPr lang="fr-FR" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp></p:spTree><p:extLst><p:ext uri="{BB962C8B-B14F-4D97-AF65-F5344CB8AC3E}"><p14:creationId xmlns:p14="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/powerpoint/2010/main" val="2446086540"/></p:ext></p:extLst></p:cSld><p:clrMapOvr><a:masterClrMapping/></p:clrMapOvr></p:sld>